Maintainer: Debangan Dey <ddey1@alumni.jh.edu>
Description: Estimates the latent correlation of multivariate mixed data
    (continuous, truncated, ordinal with any number of categories, and binary),
    and performs covariance estimation and functional principal component analysis
    for continuous, truncated and discrete (ordinal or binary) functional data. The
    methods are described in Dey and Zipunnikov (2022) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2205.06868>
    and Dey, Ghosal, Merikangas and Zipunnikov (2024) <doi:10.1002/sim.10240>.
